Linker map for the A2L Update Tool demo project (GCC ld flavour).
The address file is the only source of truth for symbol addresses and sizes.
Symbol names follow the IO-suffix convention: "_C" = calibration, "_M" = measurement.

.cal
                0x00200000                0x10 cal_Nvm_Backup_C
                0x00200010                0x08 cal_EngineSpeed_Max_C
                0x00200018                0x08 cal_TorqueLimit_Max_C
                0x00200020                0x04 cal_RteChannelTimeout_C
                0x00200024                0x04 cal_DiagCounter_C
                0x00200028                0x04 cal_DiagPendingMask_C

.meas
                0x00400000                0x04 meas_EngineSpeed_M
                0x00400004                0x04 meas_VehicleSpeed_M
                0x00400008                0x04 meas_ThrottlePosition_M
                0x0040000c                0x04 meas_BrakePedalPosition_M
                0x00400010                0x04 meas_RteChannelId_M
                0x00400014                0x04 meas_RteChannelState_M
                0x00400018                0x04 meas_RteChannelErrorFlags_M
                0x0040001c                0x04 meas_DiagFrameCounter_M
                0x00400020                0x08 meas_RteChannelTable_M
                0x00400028                0x08 meas_DiagFramePending_M
